<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mamadi Kandia</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1854</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Mamadi Kandia was the last king of Kaarta, the Bambara state of the Massassi dynasty in the western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sahel">Sahel</a>. In 1854 the Tijani <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jihad">jihad</a> leader Umar Tall conquered Kaarta, took its capital Nioro and executed him. Kaarta then became part of Umar's Toucouleur empire, which ruled it until the French conquest.</p></div>
